# VM image build output. charly emits the disk and the cloud-init seed from the VM
# entity source: URL and its cloud_init: block. Neither is a source artefact, and a
# bed run rewrites seed.iso, so a tracked copy drifts on every run.
image/*/
# charly check-run output (`.check/<bed>/<calver>/`) — regenerated on every run.
.check/
